Duchess is a action, crime, thriller film directed by Neil Marshall.

3
00:19:56,470 --> 00:20:02,470
A tough, working-class petty criminal is drawn into the treacherous world of diamond smuggling
and morphs into an anti-heroine to be reckoned with in the murky underworld.

4
00:26:35,294 --> 00:26:41,294
Scarlett Monaghan / Duchess, played by Charlotte Kirk.

5
00:33:14,117 --> 00:33:20,117
Robert McNaughton, played by Philip Winchester.

6
